有餐點只有櫻花蝦炒飯具備餐廳應有水準。整個用餐時間餐廳內其他小孩大聲的吵鬧、尖叫、敲桌子沒停過，店員當沒見到沒聽到，整體環境比夜市還糟糕。\n座位配置也是很奇葩，重點是消費金額不低，兩人隨便吃吃人均550+，但真沒這價值，真是同情又可憐景美鄉親，還好不會再來了。",null,[0,81]]]],[null,1767050614000000,1767050614000000,"8 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfZkI3LWdNSXU3bUhocEZsOWxJbGRTdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfZkI3LWdNSXU3bUhocEZsOWxJbGRTdxoTQ2d3STlwck15Z1lRX2RUXzJBRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwikrJ7WxNKWAxVfbPUHHXGjLL0Q_2MIuQEoDQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16463537660357008373/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPVTJNelJtaFZWbFp4VVd4Q1UweFhWbEZSZWxwdlVUQm9VRk14UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16463537660357008373/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPVTJNelJtaFZWbFp4VVd4Q1UweFhWbEZSZWxwdlVUQm9VRk14UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16463537660357008373/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPVTJNelJtaFZWbFp4VVd4Q1UweFhWbEZSZWxwdlVUQm9VRk14UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16463537660357008373/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPVTJNelJtaFZWbFp4VVd4Q1UweFhWbEZSZWxwdlVUQm9VRk14UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16463537660357008373/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPVTJNelJtaFZWbFp4VVd4Q1UweFhWbEZSZWxwdlVUQm9VRk14UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16463537660357008373/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFPVTJNelJtaFZWbFp4VVd4Q1UweFhWbEZSZWxwdlVUQm9VRk14UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好，\n感謝您花時間留下這麼詳細的回饋，也很抱歉這次的用餐體驗沒有達到您的期待。\n\n關於您提到的餐點部分，我們會再全面檢視食材處理與烹調狀況，確保品質能穩定呈現；至於用餐環境與現場秩序，當下未能即時做好提醒與引導，影響您的感受，這是我們需要加強的地方。\n\n每一則意見我們都會內部檢討，作為調整與改進的依據。很遺憾這次沒有留下好的印象，但仍謝謝您願意直言指教，讓我們有反省與進步的機會。祝您一切順心。",null,[0,45]]]],[null,null,12540,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZEN